  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Grate carrot. Roughly chop brown onion. Finely chop or crush garlic.\n• Drain and rinse kidney beans.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f84bd30d0527cba53abc3e/step-3a149900.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Heat a large frying pan over medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil.\n• Cook onion and kidney beans until tender, 4-5 mins.\n• Add tomato paste and Mediterranean seasoning and cook until fragrant, 1-2 mins.\n• Reduce heat to medium, then stir in the water and butter and cook until slightly thickened, 1 min. Season with salt and pepper to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f84bd30d0527cba53abc3e/step-b7f27010.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large bowl, combine carrot, salad leaves and drizzle of olive oil and white wine vinegar. Season to taste.\n• Microwave mini flourtortillas on a microwave-safe plate in 10 second bursts until warmed through.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f84bd30d0527cba53abc3e/step-53238d20.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Build mini wraps by spreading tortillas with the mayonnaise, then filling with salad and Mediterranean beans.\n• Crumble with fetta cubes to serve.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f84bd30d0527cba53abc3e/step-dd275530.jpeg"
    }
  ]
